{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/CKW_0548-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/CKW_0553-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/R0030061-683x1024.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/R0030086-683x1024.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/R0030104-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/R0030110-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/R0030163-1024x768.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/R0030168-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/R0030247-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/R0030253-683x1024.jpeg\">\n    <p>國際新聞通訊社《路透社》（ Retures ）在本年度 3 月中曾發布一篇有關 Banksy 真實身份的調查報道，報道指 Banksy 的真實身份為來自英國碧仙桃／布里斯托（ Bristol ）藝術家 Robin Gunningham ，報道亦指出 Gunningham 在 2000 年 9 月身處紐約時，因於時裝品牌 Marc Jacobs 廣告板上塗鴉被捕，其親筆證供及法庭文件均為其本人署名，及後他於 2008 年通過前經理人協助下，改名為 David Jones 。</p>\n    <p>而 Banksy 的代表律師 Mark Stephens 回應報道，指其中許多細節並非正確，亦強調匿名制度對保護藝術家免受威脅及維護言論與創作自由實屬重要。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\">\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T17:42:47.551236+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":11,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}